  dialogueLines:
  - Alrighty, good luck, have fun, and please ignore any bugs you happen to come
    across
  - Okay then, good luck and have fun! And remember, any bugs you see are definitely
    not my problem
  - "Alright, off you go! Have fun, and just pretend you didn\u2019t notice anything
    that looks a little broken"
  - Good luck, have fun, and please be kind to my poor little game if you encounter
